      // koyu, cilal\u0131 bir zemin; ayakta \u0131\u015F\u0131k havuzu, zeminde \xFCr\xFCn\xFCn renginde yumu\u015Fak yans\u0131ma ve ufuk par\u0131lt\u0131s\u0131.
