        // dolar, tepesinde mukarnas\u0131 and\u0131ran ince oluklar; kenar\u0131nda iki alt\u0131n \xE7izgi ve aralar\u0131nda sekiz
        // k\xF6\u015Feli y\u0131ld\u0131z dizisi; \xE7izgilerde yava\u015F\xE7a yukar\u0131 s\xFCz\xFClen bir par\u0131lt\u0131, kemer ayaklar\u0131nda ba\u015Fl\u0131klar,
